# Build output
/build/

# The frozen Rust 1.2.0 crate (rust-old/): the functional spec, read as text and never built (ADR 0005). Its sources
# and Cargo.lock stay as tagged; a cargo build left over from before the port must never be committed.
/rust-old/target/
/rust-old/**/__pycache__/
/rust-old/coverage/

# The reference tooling (scripts/oracle/, Python and MPFR)
/scripts/**/__pycache__/

